With the vault outside the repo and a null `path`, the project tier root is the vault itself:
`--tier project` creates nothing and prints the vault root alone; `ls` shows the repo and the vault
untouched.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/home/Claude/probe/sprints.md --
sprints
-- cmd --
booping specs init --tier project
ls -A
ls ../home/Claude/probe
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
{HOME}/Claude/probe
.booping
sprints.md
-- stderr --
